{{!--
  Blast RESOLUTION card (CP2020 p.108) — one card for the whole detonation, posted after the confirm has
  applied it. Rendered via renderChatCard with
  { weaponName, radius, baseDamage, rows: [{ name, damage, note, breakdown }] }.

  ⭐ WHY THIS CARD EXISTS (2026-08-28, ruling A). The ruling puts a collapsed per-figure math line on the
  spread AND blast resolution cards, and the blast had no resolution card at all: the CONFIRM card is
  posted at placement, BEFORE anything is applied, and at that moment the hit locations have not been
  rolled — so a breakdown printed there would state SP the shot never met. What a reader could see after
  a detonation was a set of progression cards and prompts with no statement of who was caught, for how
  much, or what stopped it. This is the blast's counterpart to spread-result.hbs and is deliberately its
  twin in shape: same wrapper, same row list, same partial, same reasons for the DIV rows.

  `modeNote` is a PRE-LOCALIZED card-level clause or an empty string — it names the branch the WHOLE
  detonation was applied through when that branch is not the ordinary one (Listen Up p.105 concussion
  ignores SP entirely, so there is no armour math to disclose and the card says so ONCE — the per-row
  repetition of the same sentence was the reported density, 2026-08-28). `note` remains a per-row
  clause for a row-specific branch; both empty on the ordinary core application.
  i18n via CPLocal; triple-stash where the string carries <b>.
--}}
<div class="cyberpunk save-prompt">
  <h3>{{CPLocal "ExplosionResultTitle" weapon=weaponName}}</h3>
  <div class="save-info">
    <span>{{{CPLocal "ExplosionResultSummary" radius=radius damage=baseDamage}}}</span>
    <div class="cp-spread-result-list">
      {{#if modeNote}}<div class="cp-spread-result-row">{{modeNote}}</div>{{/if}}
      {{#each rows}}
        <div class="cp-spread-result-row">{{{CPLocal "ExplosionResultRow" name=this.name damage=this.damage}}}</div>
        {{#if this.note}}<div class="cp-spread-result-row">{{this.note}}</div>{{/if}}
        {{#if this.breakdown}}{{> "modules/cp2020-augmented/templates/chat/parts/area-breakdown.hbs" breakdown=this.breakdown}}{{/if}}
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
